  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given, the operations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>*</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8857;</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>*</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8857;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8857;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a tautology, then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>*</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8857;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> is</p><p>We will check each option one by one,</p><p>For option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>put&#160;</mtext><mo>*</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8857;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#923;</mi></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtext>where&#160;c&#160;is&#160;contradiction</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p>Now for option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>put&#160;</mtext><mo>*</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8857;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtext>where&#160;T&#160;is&#160;tautology</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp; Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the answer.</p></blockquote>"
